abstract: >-
  The B-AI DataLab is a deterministic-first, AI-optional educational technology
  environment for statistics and data science education. It supports reasoning
  about analytical decisions through six laboratories: Model Doctor, Model Court,
  Leakage Detective, Break the Model, Uncertainty Lab, and Human vs AI Statistician.
